Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 02:34:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(deps):=20drop=20@babel/core=208=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20it=20breaks=20the=20service-worker=20build?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

eslint-plugin-react-hooks@7.1.1 peer-depends on eslint only, not
@babel/core, so the dependency was added on a wrong premise. At the root
it shadows the @babel/core ^7.24.4 that workbox-build needs, and
`bun run build` fails with 'Requires Babel "^7.0.0-0", but was loaded
with "8.0.1"' while generating dist/sw.js.

Removing it lets workbox resolve 7.29.0. Lint still reports 0 errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bun.lock     | 729 ++-------------------------------------------------
 package.json |   1 -
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 704 deletions(-)

